Durante private code-replay notification ABI for pinned DynamoRIO
6847bb210bea0ca11d1bf47704383d6a075da490.  Apply after the existing
vfork/lifetime patch.  This reports only actual modified-code dispatch re-entry:
fault retry, completed sandbox write, and pre-instrumentation sandbox entry.
The fault path restores application registers before dispatch instead of leaking
code-cache scratch values.  Generic restore-state queries remain informational.

